      "Decision question. This prospective study evaluates source access expiry in one bounded outsourced-assistant workflow. The unit is a queue item with at least one source link. It reports no OutsourcedAssistants.com performance and makes no causal, legal, security, financial, employment, or service-quality claim.",
      "Method overview for source access expiry. Capture link target, permission state, source version, observation time, failure type, recovery route, and owner. Compare a documented baseline with scheduled link verification at intake, decision handoff, and closure. The field dictionary, inclusion rules, sampling method, and analysis code are frozen before outcomes are examined.",
      "Field audit. Before analysis, independently trace each required field for source access expiry back to the source that created it and the system event that last changed it. Mark whether the value is observed, derived, owner-supplied, or reviewer-coded. Retain nulls and conflicts; do not convert absence into a negative result. Reconcile extracted records to source control totals and explain exclusions by reason. Reperform a subset from the original systems using the frozen dictionary, compare the second result with the first, and preserve disagreement before adjudication. This audit distinguishes a workflow finding from an extraction defect and makes the eventual denominator reviewable. Record the extractor, query or export version, execution time, time-zone conversion, and checksum so a later reviewer can determine whether a changed result came from the workflow or the evidence pipeline.",
      "Preregister the decision. State the decision this study may inform and the claim it cannot support. Freeze the population, observation window, systems, roles, time zones, exclusions, and analysis plan before viewing outcomes. For source access expiry, stage 1 must preserve link target, permission state, source version, observation time, failure type, recovery route, and owner. Reviewers distinguish what the system recorded from what the business concluded and retain alternative explanations when evidence conflicts.",
      "Define the unit. Give each included observation one stable key and a clear entry and exit event. Separate a queue item, human action, owner decision, and destination event rather than counting them as interchangeable work. For source access expiry, stage 2 must preserve link target, permission state, source version, observation time, failure type, recovery route, and owner. Reviewers distinguish what the system recorded from what the business concluded and retain alternative explanations when evidence conflicts.",
      "Build the evidence map. Preserve source facts, assistant preparation, owner decisions, execution, and verification in separate fields. Record unavailable evidence instead of replacing it with an inference. For source access expiry, stage 3 must preserve link target, permission state, source version, observation time, failure type, recovery route, and owner. Reviewers distinguish what the system recorded from what the business concluded and retain alternative explanations when evidence conflicts.",
      "Control access and retention. Use synthetic cases first, then purpose-limited operational samples only with approved access. Keep sensitive source records in their governed systems and remove temporary study permissions. For source access expiry, stage 4 must preserve link target, permission state, source version, observation time, failure type, recovery route, and owner. Reviewers distinguish what the system recorded from what the business concluded and retain alternative explanations when evidence conflicts.",
      "Freeze the baseline. Observe comparable cycles before changing the workflow. Record volume, exception mix, owner availability, outages, policy changes, and seasonal events that could explain a result. For source access expiry, stage 5 must preserve link target, permission state, source version, observation time, failure type, recovery route, and owner. Reviewers distinguish what the system recorded from what the business concluded and retain alternative explanations when evidence conflicts.",
      "Apply one intervention. Introduce the specified control without simultaneously changing staffing, tools, definitions, and deadlines. Log unavoidable changes as limitations rather than attributing every difference to the intervention. For source access expiry, stage 6 must preserve link target, permission state, source version, observation time, failure type, recovery route, and owner. Reviewers distinguish what the system recorded from what the business concluded and retain alternative explanations when evidence conflicts.",
      "Review independently. Have trained reviewers classify selected observations before discussion. Preserve disagreement, confidence, unavailable records, and the reason a final disposition changed. For source access expiry, stage 7 must preserve link target, permission state, source version, observation time, failure type, recovery route, and owner. Reviewers distinguish what the system recorded from what the business concluded and retain alternative explanations when evidence conflicts.",
      "Sample representatively. Include every predefined high-consequence exception and a reproducible random sample of ordinary work. Document substitutions so easy cases cannot silently replace unavailable records. For source access expiry, stage 8 must preserve link target, permission state, source version, observation time, failure type, recovery route, and owner. Reviewers distinguish what the system recorded from what the business concluded and retain alternative explanations when evidence conflicts.",
      "Measure without hiding risk. Report counts with denominators, medians, ranges, age bands, corrections, rework, and unresolved cases. Do not let numerous low-risk completions offset one unauthorized or harmful action. For source access expiry, stage 9 must preserve link target, permission state, source version, observation time, failure type, recovery route, and owner. Reviewers distinguish what the system recorded from what the business concluded and retain alternative explanations when evidence conflicts.",
      "Test sensitivity. Repeat calculations under plausible cutoff, missing-evidence, pause-time, risk-band, and unresolved-case treatments. Identify conclusions that depend on policy choices. For source access expiry, stage 10 must preserve link target, permission state, source version, observation time, failure type, recovery route, and owner. Reviewers distinguish what the system recorded from what the business concluded and retain alternative explanations when evidence conflicts.",
      "Trace corrective action. Link each finding to an owner, due date, implementation reference, verification result, and residual limitation. A meeting or revised instruction is not proof that operating state changed. For source access expiry, stage 11 must preserve link target, permission state, source version, observation time, failure type, recovery route, and owner. Reviewers distinguish what the system recorded from what the business concluded and retain alternative explanations when evidence conflicts.",
      "State the validity boundary. Limit conclusions to the observed population, period, systems, people, and definitions. Set a reassessment trigger for changed tools, owners, volume, policy, or threat conditions. For source access expiry, stage 12 must preserve link target, permission state, source version, observation time, failure type, recovery route, and owner. Reviewers distinguish what the system recorded from what the business concluded and retain alternative explanations when evidence conflicts.",
      "Interpretation for source access expiry. A result is useful only if the receiving owner can connect it to a bounded operating choice such as retaining the control, clarifying the brief, narrowing access, changing review coverage, or pausing the lane. Faster or cleaner status alone does not establish a better business outcome.",
